  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">2인 1조로 천사점토 70g과 물감을 주고 지구내부구조 모형을 만드는 활동을 진행했습니다. <br><br>진행하기전에 아래와같이 반지름 계산을 통해 층상구조가 잘 드러나게 표현해달라고 말했습니다. <br>모형의 특징을 이야기해주며 대응물이 무엇이 되는지, 대략적인 설계도도 그려보고 만들라고 계획서를 작성했습니다. </p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cc258b0fcdb92a7914cdea1f1d9aeb86ef9454bc\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cc258b0fcdb92a7914cdea1f1d9aeb86ef9454bc\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>학생들의 결과물입니다. </p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cfdf71696a85970a40f2f957c6c13db59cd9ce76\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cfdf71696a85970a40f2f957c6c13db59cd9ce76\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">겉으로보면 예쁜 복숭아 </p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/65ba56ba6f075446a262562b2d265feb2c08c713\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/65ba56ba6f075446a262562b2d265feb2c08c713\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">열면 지구내부구조가! </p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b06204829eb2af6fee8d51e311173f21919b5b35\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b06204829eb2af6fee8d51e311173f21919b5b35\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">사실 계산한 값 그대로 만들기는 너무 어려워서 대략적인 비율만 맞춰서 만들어달라고 했습니다. <br>가끔 아이들이 4개의 공을 만들고 어떡해요? 하는데 내핵을 먼저 만들고 감싸는 형태로 만들어야한다고 미리 알려주면 잘 만들더라고요!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b9ee6eb7c5c19e5f3e3e6ed5a1c762a964312e0c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b9ee6eb7c5c19e5f3e3e6ed5a1c762a964312e0c\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">요것도 지구내부구조 모형입니다..<br>자르니까 피가 철철,,, <br></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvq8p6wnny63f81t6r92uyi5j@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"720\" data-video-height=\"1280\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvq8p6wnny63f81t6r92uyi5j/thumbs/6.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33235828045&amp;signature=SMaXbubOgUqTMjMc1Xj9lNXMfcc%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"720\" data-video-origin-height=\"1280\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvq8p6wnny63f81t6r92uyi5j?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2cThwNndubnk2M2Y4MXQ2cjkydXlpNWoiLCJ0aWQiOiJkODAwMTY5OS00ZDkwLTQ5ZTYtYjU3Yi00ZTAxMjUwYmMxOGYiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODYzODN9.dBOl4dNqcYL1J8559PgQVVIOPJ0gD_xo7N2nYuGVDYVICC82lfvU15BX2EH31qSa7yWpaO3FmzxD-qP9ayh8Yw&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"720\" height=\"1280\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">자르는 영상을 찍게해서 한 반 분량으로 모아서 릴스나 유튜브영상으로 올려주었습니다. <br><br><a href=\"https://youtu.be/4BD_PLv9Plw\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/4BD_PLv9Plw</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"[중학교1학년] 지구내부구조 모형만들기\" data-og-description=\"여기를 눌러 링크를 확인하세요\" data-og-host=\"www.youtube.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://youtu.be/4BD_PLv9Plw\" data-og-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4BD_PLv9Plw\" data-og-image=\"\"><a href=\"https://youtu.be/4BD_PLv9Plw\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://youtu.be/4BD_PLv9Plw\"><div class=\"og-image\" style=\"background-image:url()\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">[중학교1학년] 지구내부구조 모형만들기</p><p class=\"og-desc\">여기를 눌러 링크를 확인하세요</p><p class=\"og-host\">www.youtube.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><br>학생들이 정말 좋아하는 활동이었고 자르는 저도 재밌었네요 </p><div data-ke-type=\"emoticon\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-emoticon-type=\"friends1\" data-emoticon-name=\"014\" data-emoticon-isanimation=\"true\" data-emoticon-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/keditor/emoticon/friends1/large/014.gif\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/keditor/emoticon/friends1/large/014.gif\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
